{"state":"ready"}
# The wipe unconditionally deletes every gen_* file, including the one left by a *clean* prior
# shutdown (spec 10.1 step 1 applies regardless of how the previous process ended) - numbering
# restarts at generation 1, matching DrillStaleGenerationFilesTest's documented behavior.
